WEBVTT

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:03.850 line:95%,end
Hello, I'm Alexander Hübel, I'm the CEO of PubliX Group.

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:06.830 line:95%,end
We are a Stockholm-based buy-and-build platform,

00:00:06.830 --> 00:00:11.810 line:95%,end
PE-backed. Buy-and-build means that we acquire SaaS companies from Northern

00:00:11.810 --> 00:00:14.030 line:95%,end
Europe that are focusing on the public sector,

00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:17.350 line:95%,end
and we help them take the next step in their growth journey.

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:19.940 line:95%,end
These companies are often born in the 2010s –

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:22.540 line:95%,end
they've been around for 10, 15 years.

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:26.500 line:95%,end
They often have some kind of technical debt.

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:29.560 line:95%,end
They also, of course, serve the public sector.

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:35.480 line:95%,end
Serving the public sector requires winning public tenders in many cases.

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:42.500 line:95%,end
And scaling often requires both going outside of the core market,

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:48.560 line:95%,end
which might be one Nordic country, and going into adjacent workflows.

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:53.240 line:95%,end
Both of these would often require capital and competence.

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:59.340 line:95%,end
Often these companies lack both of these in order to scale properly.

00:00:59.340 --> 00:01:08.100 line:95%,end
They often have 15–20 employees, and they just are unable to take that next step.

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:09.420 line:95%,end
That is where PubliX comes in.

00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:14.760 line:95%,end
So we help them unlock the next growth engine in their journey.

00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:21.050 line:95%,end
So what we do is that first, we help them win tenders in their home market,

00:01:21.050 --> 00:01:22.490 line:95%,end
to get a higher win rate.

00:01:22.490 --> 00:01:26.030 line:95%,end
We also help them enter new markets.

00:01:26.030 --> 00:01:29.630 line:95%,end
If you are a Finnish company, you might want to enter the Swedish market.

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:31.230 line:95%,end
It's a totally different language.

00:01:31.230 --> 00:01:32.890 line:95%,end
Then we also work with cross-selling.

00:01:32.890 --> 00:01:35.890 line:95%,end
So if you are a company selling to municipalities,

00:01:35.890 --> 00:01:40.150 line:95%,end
you might also start to sell to the region, to healthcare.

00:01:40.150 --> 00:01:42.510 line:95%,end
So we open the doors –

00:01:42.510 --> 00:01:43.290 line:95%,end
warm introductions –

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:51.010 line:95%,end
to increase the number of meetings the companies have with relevant customers.

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:54.030 line:95%,end
So we reignite them, you can say.

00:01:54.030 --> 00:01:58.570 line:95%,end
We bring a bit of a cultural transformation, a growth mindset,

00:01:58.570 --> 00:02:04.390 line:95%,end
a scale-up mindset, where you really get laser-focused on customer problems –

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:09.390 line:95%,end
solving customer problems with existing and new products.

00:02:09.390 --> 00:02:10.340 line:95%,end
Focus on growth.

00:02:10.340 --> 00:02:14.760 line:95%,end
Collaboration is one of the key things, and we do this in multiple ways.

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:19.740 line:95%,end
One is that we have regular sessions where we meet physically.

00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:25.940 line:95%,end
We bring all employees together, and during these events we sit and we build things.

00:02:25.940 --> 00:02:29.340 line:95%,end
We solve problems together and we come up with ideas.

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:34.090 line:95%,end
And it's amazing to see how great ideas you get when you mix business people.

00:02:34.090 --> 00:02:38.100 line:95%,end
Now we are actively acquiring in the Northern European market.

00:02:38.940 --> 00:02:43.220 line:95%,end
So we are looking for companies that are profitable,

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:47.020 line:95%,end
that have a decent growth rate –

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:49.980 line:95%,end
but now it's time to join something bigger.

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:55.460 line:95%,end
To join a group where you can still keep operating your company,

00:02:55.460 --> 00:02:59.460 line:95%,end
still take the decisions yourself, as an entrepreneur –

00:02:59.460 --> 00:03:02.130 line:95%,end
to get all the help with all the tricky things –

00:03:02.130 --> 00:03:04.280 line:95%,end
and you get so many good,

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:08.870 line:95%,end
inspired, competent colleagues that will help you along the journey.

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:12.270 line:95%,end
If you want to know more, don't hesitate to reach out.

00:03:12.270 --> 00:03:14.570 line:95%,end
Book a meeting, click the button below –

00:03:14.570 --> 00:03:15.890 line:95%,end
we would love to connect.
